  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ID: OHCHR  - Office of the High Commissioner for Human Rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(USAID Bureau for Inclusive Growth, Partnerships, and Innovation (IPI)):  The Voluntary Fund for Indigenous Peoples (VFIP) supports the participation of representatives of Indigenous peoples&apos; organizations and institutions in the consultation process in relevant United Nations (UN) body meetings, so they can best advocate for Indigenous Peoples&apos; rights worldwide.  FY 2024 funds will support attendance and engagement of representatives of Indigenous peoples to ensure their voice is part of UN deliberations.  This program contributes to the National Security Strategy and the Joint Strategic Plan by helping to create a prosperous world through supporting inclusive economic growth, supporting the dignity of individuals, empowering local actors to seek enduring solutions to their development challenges, and improving and adapting policy and foreign assistance to advance the inclusion of Indigenous peoples. This IM implements the Indigenous People directive/earmark.</narrative>
  </description>
